    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30659" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγᾦδα</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγᾦμαι</span></b> , 
			Att.
		 crasis for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγὼ οἶδα, ἐγὼ
		οἶμαι</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγών</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγώνγα</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγώνη</span></b> , dialectic forms of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγώ, ἔγωγε</span> (q. v.). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδααία:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρημία</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδάην</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ης</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, η</span>, aor. 2 of
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δάω</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδαλάχθη:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδήχθη</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδάμην</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ης</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, η</span>, 
			Ep.
		
		aor. 2
		
			Pass.
		 of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαμάω</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδάνη:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος ἀμπέλου</span>, Id.</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
